OL,3,GNEWSASon's stadium tribute to dad
OL,4,Amissing in Nepal flood
OL,5,
OL,6,FPatel said he was told by the Foreign
OL,7,FOffice on Sunday that Chinese
OL,8,Fauthorities had officially classified
OL,9,Fhis father, 66, and mother, Mala, 60,
OL,10,Fas missing after they crossed from
OL,11,FNepal into Tibet before a landslide
OL,12,Fstruck the Gyirong border crossing last
OL,13,FWednesday.
OL,15,F"It is a step in the right direction
OL,16,Ffor the full picture on what exactly
OL,17,Fhas happened," Patel said.
